proposal = "In services/human/crates/layerx-human-security-provider/src/state.rs validate the selected operation, success code and recovery-policy identity after authenticating its containing transaction. Preserve the explicit administrator principal association, and reject committed failures and non-recovery receipts at ingestion, reveal and replay."
